 "summary": "Procedural, modular language standardised by CCITT/ITU-T (Recommendation Z.200, also ISO/IEC 9496) for programming telephone switching systems, with modes, regions, processes, signals and buffers for concurrency; CHILL 2000 added object orientation and generics.",
 "status": "historical",
